# ESP32-S3 INMP441 I²S Diagnostic — Supplied Serial Output

- Date: 2026-11-09 (exact capture time not supplied).
- Host: Ubuntu.
- Serial port: `/dev/ttyACM0`.
- Serial monitor baud: 115200.
- Target: reported ESP32-S3 N16R8 + INMP441.
- Test mode: I²S master RX, 16 kHz, 32-bit slots, RIGHT_LEFT.
- Firmware commit: not recorded.
- Source: serial output pasted by the project owner into the engineering session.
- Capture limitation: this is the supplied serial output, not a complete shell/build/upload transcript. No missing command output has been reconstructed.

